{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2605About the Soundtrack\u2605</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the official soundtrack for DLC1 <strong>&quot;Rose Idol&quot;</strong> of <i>Touhou Hero of Ice Fairy</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The music collection includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 exclusive extended mix</strong> that seamlessly weaves all DLC1 tracks into a single epic journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 original tracks</strong> featured in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 instrumental versions</strong> (no vocal tracks)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 transitional segments</strong> extracted from the extended mix for smooth progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meticulously produced, this soundtrack\u2019s standout feature is its <strong>extended mix</strong> \u2013 a carefully crafted arrangement unique to this release. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the melodies of &quot;<strong>Rose Idol</strong>&quot; and enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564980?t=1743686146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3564980?t=1743686146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564980/937d5678f21731ed6beeccd1f28bbdf6c831bdda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743686146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564980/937d5678f21731ed6beeccd1f28bbdf6c831bdda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743686146","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2605About the Soundtrack\u2605</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the official soundtrack for DLC1 <strong>&quot;Ro